==Danish==

===Etymology===
From {{der|da|gml|kunst}}, from {{der|da|gem-pro|*kunstiz||knowledge, ability}}, derived from the verb {{m|gem-pro|*kunnaną||to know}}. Cognate with {{cog|de|Kunst}} and {{cog|nl|kunst}}. {{cog|sv|konst}} was also borrowed from Low German.

